    <item>
      <title>[03] WMIC</title>
      <link>http://127.0.0.1:1313/docs/03_techniques/03-wmic/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://127.0.0.1:1313/docs/03_techniques/03-wmic/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;div style=&#34;margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #6b7280; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;&#34;&gt;
  
    &lt;span style=&#34;display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;&#34;&gt;
      By:
      
        
        
        
        
          
          
          
            
          
          
          &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/prasannavbalaji&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; style=&#34;display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-weight: 600; color: #0a66c2; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;&#34; onmouseover=&#34;this.style.borderBottom=&#39;1px solid #0a66c2&#39;&#34; onmouseout=&#34;this.style.borderBottom=&#39;1px solid transparent&#39;&#34;&gt;
            &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; width=&#34;14&#34; height=&#34;14&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;&gt;
                &lt;path d=&#34;M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z&#34;/&gt;
            &lt;/svg&gt;
            Prasanna
          &lt;/a&gt;
        
      
    &lt;/span&gt;
  

  
    &lt;span style=&#34;color: #d1d5db;&#34;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;time style=&#34;font-style: italic;&#34;&gt;October 26, 2026&lt;/time&gt;
  
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What is WMIC ?&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;what-is-wmic-&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#what-is-wmic-&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;WMI is Windows Management Instrumentation is typically used for managing data in a windows operating system Its also highly efficient just like power shell since a user will be able to write scripts to automate tasks in a remote device. Due to this functionality its required to implement security features to prevent any unauthenticated services and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Security with WMIC:&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;security-with-wmic&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#security-with-wmic&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;WMI security focuses on protecting access to namespace data. WMI first grants access to groups of users as specified by the &lt;em&gt;WMI Control&lt;/em&gt; and DCOM settings and then providers determine if the user should have access to namespace data. Namespace security depends on standard Windows user &lt;em&gt;security identifiers (SID)&lt;/em&gt; and the &lt;em&gt;security descriptor&lt;/em&gt; for the WMI namespace. You can set namespace security by performing the following actions WMIC is capable of invoking XLS scripts, this allows an attacker to push a malicious excel script which could provide a reverse shell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will use kodiac to generate malicious XLS script, lets download the framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;STEP 1: open terminal a type the following command&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-1-open-terminal-a-type-the-following-command&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#step-1-open-terminal-a-type-the-following-command&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;$ git clone &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;https://github.com/zerosum0x0/koadic.git&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;](&lt;/span&gt;https://github.com/zerosum0x0/koadic.git&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copy code&#34;
    aria-label=&#34;Copy code&#34;
    data-copied-label=&#34;Copied!&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;STEP 2: Move to the kodic directory &amp;amp; install the dependencies&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-2-move-to-the-kodic-directory--install-the-dependencies&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#step-2-move-to-the-kodic-directory--install-the-dependencies&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;$ &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; koadic
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;$ pip3 install -r requirements.txt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copy code&#34;
    aria-label=&#34;Copy code&#34;
    data-copied-label=&#34;Copied!&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;STEP 3: Run kodic &amp;amp; Generate the XLS file&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-3-run-kodic--generate-the-xls-file&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#step-3-run-kodic--generate-the-xls-file&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;$ use stager/js/wmic
